<!--
    Notification small icon: the system keeps only the alpha channel of this drawable and paints it
    with the notification accent colour, so the artwork has to be a single-layer silhouette on a
    transparent canvas. The launcher icon (@mipmap/rd_push_icon) cannot be used for this because its
    adaptive background layer is fully opaque, which leaves the status bar with a shapeless blob.
-->
